; Example only: the online leaderboard's settings, with placeholder values.
; The real file is called supabase.cfg and lives in Godot's user folder on your computer
; (Mac: ~/Library/Application Support/Godot/app_userdata/Merry Scary Christmas/),
; never in this repository. Get the real values from a teammate in a private message.
; Only the public (publishable) key goes here, never the secret / service role key.
[supabase]
url="https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co"
key="YOUR-PUBLISHABLE-KEY"
